  "title": "Zucchini Bread with Dried Fruits and Nuts",
  "description": "Dried fruit and nuts add flavor and texture to moist zucchini bread in this super simple recipe that makes two loaves... one to eat and one to share.",
  "authors": [
    "Sue"
  ],
